    <item>
      <title>Version 1.4.0</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 11:10:50 -0500</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202609021110</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>Lock any file or folder from Finder's right-click menu — a locked item cannot be changed, renamed, moved or deleted by anything, including agents, because it uses macOS's own immutable flag rather than a marker only Celestia would respect. Cloud badges now explain themselves: Finder's native progress and error UI show what is happening and what went wrong. New right-click actions: Copy Vault Path, Open in Obsidian, Check the Vault for Changes. Editing a note's body no longer reformats its frontmatter.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/zaicv/the-noc-releases/releases/download/celestia-v1.4.0/Celestia-1.4.0.dmg" length="4759550" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="XHsh9njAqh7ywRAz1sgBpL8/h/CG/Jb+NzVSGZ7hE04GsBYXtcCoHZ6TiBhAok+cHHa6vlUe1cbEP0dM4pScCA==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.3.9</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 10:46:25 -0500</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202609021044</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>Fixes edits from a client failing to save when that Mac was set to need approval — Celestia now identifies itself as a person, and a person's own save is never queued for their own review. The vault index is fetched incrementally instead of whole, so an edit costs kilobytes rather than megabytes on every connected Mac.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/zaicv/the-noc-releases/releases/download/celestia-v1.3.9/Celestia-1.3.9.dmg" length="4726966" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="a33O50LbedoewZQkNTorgeybkc20a/3K2aWE51QE5PRaTT95aazqMbFSBEUprhOgV2KbjAk6Ysh9YaFtnuWWDg==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.3.8</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 10:12:12 -0500</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202609021011</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>Finder is much faster: the vault index is fetched once and shared instead of re-downloaded for every file shown, and edits now sync as incremental changes rather than forcing a full re-read of the whole vault. Transient network drops retry instead of leaving an error badge. New Developer Log window with verbose tracing, on clients as well as the home server.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/zaicv/the-noc-releases/releases/download/celestia-v1.3.8/Celestia-1.3.8.dmg" length="4714567" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="T/eDlaU7JCxiDIxeQUFppzYzd/GB/04/56RZDWYVu9VFOxB5OAES+ISKLfzCCQNXXJMSC42f4tx0+VWYG3wpCg==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.3.7</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 10:09:04 -0500</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202609021007</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>Much faster in Finder. Browsing a folder used to re-download the entire vault index for every single file it showed; it is now fetched once, shared, and kept up to date with real incremental changes instead of a full re-read on every edit. Transient network drops retry instead of leaving an error badge. Adds a Developer Log window with verbose tracing, on clients as well as the home server.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/zaicv/the-noc-releases/releases/download/celestia-v1.3.7/Celestia-1.3.7.dmg" length="4714297" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="UXxm/QP/wdiLH1ihvp+3bpBH/nm7IPPBHfSXDDCTmBjmmzhNMbsoba95o4NqZ8scXbIYzFn0IU8l/YU8yXhjCw==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.3.6</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 08:22:46 -0500</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202609020822</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>Fix: installing an update could shut the background server down and fail to start it again, leaving every client showing an empty vault. Restarting the server now waits for macOS instead of racing it, and no longer freezes the app while it works.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/zaicv/the-noc-releases/releases/download/celestia-v1.3.6/Celestia-1.3.6.dmg" length="4616136" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="FlVjkzsrU4aYXaupIpGjM1odDdKxZ4LD9aIYCLTffY/tywCFCChxEFb0z/fYtO355u6UDLYXCHc6dK6fZ1sGCg==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.3.5</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 08:14:02 -0500</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202609020813</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
